sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Django
    participant FastAPI
    participant Storage as Shared Storage
    participant YOLO as CI Training
    participant Tracker as Tracker (metadata only)
    
    User->>Django: POST /ci-training<br/>(new_data)
    Django->>FastAPI: HTTP Request
    
    FastAPI->>Storage: Read best_model_ref.json
    Storage-->>FastAPI: {path: "models/best_v5.pt"}
    FastAPI->>Storage: Load best model
    
    Note over FastAPI: Baseline metrics captured
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: baseline = previous best metrics
    
    FastAPI->>YOLO: Incremental training<br/>(load previous best, new data)
    YOLO->>YOLO: Fine-tune on new data
    YOLO->>Storage: Save checkpoint
    Tracker->>Tracker: Log metrics
    
    YOLO-->>FastAPI: CI training complete<br/>(new_metrics={mAP50:0.87})
    
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Compare metrics<br/>improvement = new - baseline
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Check: improvement > 0.01?
    
    alt improvement >= threshold
        FastAPI->>Storage: Save new model
        FastAPI->>Storage: ⚠️ UPDATE best_model_ref.json<br/>(potential race condition)
        FastAPI->>Tracker: Log improvement
        FastAPI-->>Django: SUCCESS<br/>(improved to 0.87)
        Django-->>User: Model improved!
    else no improvement
        FastAPI-->>Django: APPROVED<br/>(no improvement)
        Django-->>User: Previous model still best
    end
